Description: film scanner capture software for the Raspberry Pi HQ camera
 Capture software for a film scanner built around a Raspberry Pi and the
 Raspberry Pi HQ camera (Sony IMX477), driven through libcamera.
 .
 Features a live preview with a raw 12-bit histogram, manual exposure and
 white balance, DNG or JPG capture, motor-driven film transport over GPIO,
 and FTP or local-copy export of the captured frames.
 .
 Configuration is kept per user in ~/.config/c-gugusse/ and is created from
 the defaults in /usr/share/c-gugusse/defaults/ on first run.
